Self-hosted fonts: Gilroy (Radomir Tinkov Free Font EULA), Outfit and Unbounded
(SIL OFL 1.1). See frontend/public/fonts/LICENSES/ for the licence texts.

Backend image dependency: pillow-heif (BSD-3-Clause) decodes HEIC/HEIF uploads; its
wheels bundle libheif and libde265 (LGPL-3.0) and x265 (GPL-2.0-or-later). Their licence
texts ship inside the installed package (LICENSES_bundled.txt).

Card rendering dependencies: pypdfium2 (Apache-2.0 or BSD-3-Clause; bundles PDFium, BSD-3-Clause)
rasterises card PNGs; onnxruntime (MIT) runs the u2netp background-removal model (Apache-2.0),
which an operator fetches with `manage.py fetch_card_photo_model`. Card fonts other than the bundled
ones are fetched on demand from the Google Fonts catalogue into private storage; each family keeps
its own licence (SIL OFL 1.1, Apache-2.0 or the Ubuntu Font Licence).

Adapted code: the light/dark theme transition (frontend/src/lib/themeTransition.*) is adapted
from yuyu by twilighty-abhi (https://github.com/twilighty-abhi/yuyu), AGPL-3.0. The 404 pet
behaviour (frontend/src/components/delight/NotFoundPatch.tsx: trot, follow, wander, nap) is also
adapted from yuyu by twilighty-abhi (https://github.com/twilighty-abhi/yuyu), AGPL-3.0.

Mascot: Patch, the painted wolf (frontend/public/brand/patch/), is Space Works' own artwork, taken
unaltered from the SpaceWorks-Design repository (mascot/, and mascot/dark/ for the dark theme's
sticker-bordered files); the walk sprite sheets are its walk/ and walk-left/ frames laid side by side.

Third-party frontend packages for maker-file previews: three, fflate (MIT), linkedom (ISC),
@tracespace/core (MIT) and occt-import-js (LGPL-2.1, OpenCascade; loaded as a separate WebAssembly module).

Backend dependencies for passkeys (WebAuthn): webauthn 3.0.1 (py_webauthn, BSD-3-Clause),
pyOpenSSL 26.4.0 (Apache-2.0), pyasn1 0.6.5 (BSD-2-Clause) and pyasn1-modules 0.4.2 (BSD-2-Clause);
tldextract 5.4.0 (BSD-3-Clause) with its bundled Public Suffix List snapshot (MPL-2.0, data only),
filelock 4.2.4 (MIT) and requests-file 3.0.1 (Apache-2.0).

Frontend dependency for passkeys (WebAuthn): @simplewebauthn/browser 14.0.0 (MIT, no dependencies of its own).

Translation pipeline (phase 8 i18n): Lingui 6.10.1 (MIT) -- @lingui/core and @lingui/react at
runtime; @lingui/cli, @lingui/conf, @lingui/format-po and @lingui/vite-plugin at build time, with
@lingui/native-tools 0.1.6 (MIT) for the macro transform. The backend image installs GNU gettext
(GPL-3.0-or-later, build tool only) to compile Django's message catalogues.
